// village_economy noncombat acceptance: composite production verb that
// exercises four lift primitives in a single ability program (under the
// MAX_EFFECTS_PER_PROGRAM=6 ceiling).
//
// Per cast the dispatcher walks the program and writes one chronicle
// record per non-empty effect slot:
//   * EffectRecipeApplied   (kind=71) — Lift B: blacksmith fires recipe
//                           id=1 (ForgeIron) with no specific tool slot
//                           (sentinel 0xFF; consumer reads the
//                           caster's owned forge from inventory).
//   * EffectWearToolApplied (kind=72) — Lift B: bumps wear on the
//                           caster's tool of kind=0 (Forge) by 50/256
//                           = ~0.20 per cast. After ~5 casts the forge
//                           is worn.
//   * EffectGainSkillApplied (kind=75) — Lift D: caster gains 25/256
//                           ≈ 0.10 mastery in skill_id=0
//                           (Blacksmithing).
//   * EffectAnnounceApplied (kind=74) — Lift C: caster broadcasts
//                           announcement_kind=0 ("forge complete")
//                           within radius 3.0 cells. Per-fixture
//                           consumer fires the village's "skilled
//                           agent finished a recipe" chronicle pin.
//
// Three of the four belong to the "skill / knowledge / market" lift
// surfaces; the fourth (recipe) is the production primitive itself.
// Together with WalkToWorkshop's travel_to (Lift A) they pin "all
// four lift A-D primitives plus their consumer counters work end-to-
// end in one runtime tick" — the architectural goal of this fixture.
//
// NOTE: cast_recipe / wear_tool / gain_skill / announce all lower via
// the matching arms of `dsl_compiler::ability_lower::lower_effect_stmt`.
// `target: self` keeps the dispatcher's actor==target slot binding for
// the self-cast effects (recipe / wear_tool / gain_skill / announce
// are all caster-self-origin per the dispatcher arm comments in
// `crates/dsl_compiler/src/cpu_chronicle_reference.rs:658-743`).

ability ForgeIron {
    target: self
    cooldown: 1s
    hint: utility

    cast_recipe 1 [UTILITY: 100]
    wear_tool 0 50 [UTILITY: 100]
    gain_skill 0 25 [UTILITY: 100]
    announce 0 radius 3 [UTILITY: 100]
}
